WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.200
Two windows on one script, both signed in as Sam Okafor. Both read Saved · Synced.

00:01.200 --> 00:07.500
Window 1 types. Tab makes a character name, Enter starts the dialogue, and every letter appears in window 2 as it is typed.

00:07.500 --> 00:14.000
Window 2 types a line of action, and it appears in window 1.

00:14.000 --> 00:24.500
Window 2's network is cut. It keeps writing, and its status reads Offline, 4 waiting. Window 1 does not have those lines yet.

00:24.500 --> 00:30.000
The network is back. Window 2 reads Syncing…, then Synced, and window 1 holds every line.
